  "slug": "burritos-with-mexican-chorizo-and-potatoes",
  "name": "Burritos with Mexican Chorizo and Potatoes",
  "recipe_type": "main",
  "brief_description": "Easy to make and great for busy schedules, these simple burritos made with spicy Mexican chorizo, onions, and potatoes can be topped with sour cream to offset the heat.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican Inspired",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine chorizo and onion in a large skillet over medium heat. Cook and stir until onion is soft, about 5 minutes. Add potatoes, water, and garlic; stir well. Cover and reduce heat to medium-low. Cook, stirring every 10 minutes, until potatoes are tender, about 25 minutes. Remove from heat and spoon into warm tortillas."
    }
  ],
